  m_text: 'THE LGB COMPANY


    Dear user,


    Your subscription to the LGBTQIA+
    has been canceled and your $31 will be refunded to your bank account shortly.
    We are sad that you are leaving us and hope to see you again sometime in the
    future.


    The Slayest of Regards,


    Mrs. Less Bien.

'
