  m_text: "THE CAF\xC9 COMPANY\r\n\nDear __,\r\n\nWe have received your application
    for the position of inter-planetary affairs manager and unfortunately decided
    that you aren\u2019t fitting for our company. There are currently no other positions
    open for remote-work but we are taking applications for baristas and toilet-cleaners.\r\n\nDon\u2019t
    miss the discount on our seasonal coffee blends!\r\n\nhttps://completelylegitwebsitelink.com\r\n"
